<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-American Oncology upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-American Oncology upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Margot Durow said she upgraded American Oncology Resources to focus buy from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the physician practice management concern, which focuses on oncology, were off 1/8 to 11-1/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;We have become increasingly confident in management's ability to stabilize and improve the company's core medical oncology operations,&quot; Durow said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
